{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13029","headline":"送张南史 · 郎士元","name":"送张南史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨余深巷静，独酌送残春。\n车马虽嫌僻，莺花不弃贫。\n虫丝黏户网，鼠迹印牀尘。\n借问山阳会，如今有几人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}